.TH ferry-peer-remove 1  Ferry "Ferry Manual"
.SH NAME
ferry\-peer\-remove \- Remove a trusted device
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBferry peer remove\fR [\fB\-\-lang\fR] [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] <\fITARGET\fR> 
.SH DESCRIPTION
Remove a trusted device
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-\-lang\fR \fI<CODE>\fR
Interface language for this run (`en`, `pl`); overrides the saved setting
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
.TP
<\fITARGET\fR>
Alias or Node ID
